{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DfGB6dk2p51794302804.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市四大指數全線上升。</p><p></p><p>滬深300指數重上4,000點水平。深圳創業板指數曾經急升逾百分之2，一度突破2,500點關口，但收市未能夠企穩。滬深京三市成交逾1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>機械人概念股造好。石油天然氣板塊則下跌，中國石油A股跌逾百分之6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.147931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.684245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:01.295550+00:00","content_hash":"8a35718171a116cde83f2b455bb1253a02dd96370c8aef9120c1499776a12797","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.147931+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}